      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "IMPRESSIVE 3 BED / 2 BATH TERRACED HOME\r\n\r\nSOUTH FACING BACKGARDEN\r\n\r\nPERFECT FOR FIRST TIME BUYERS\r\n\r\nOR PARTIES TRADING DOWN.\r\n\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED.... \r\n\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and the Leonard Wilson Keenan team are truly delighted to present 79 Sillogue Gardens, Ballymun, Dublin 11 placed in an idyllic setting.\r\n\r\n\r\nNo. 79  Consists of a warm inviting Entrance Hallway, a bright and spacious open plan Kitchen/dining room. To the front you find a dual aspect front living room, the ground floor is completed by a downstairs WC.Upstairs you will find 2 spacious double bedrooms, 1 single bedroom, and shared Bathroom.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe open plan Kitchen/dinning room with sliding glass doors lead out to the south facing low maintenance garden. The kitchen with its selection of units to include integrated appliances with ample base and eye level storage.The front living room just off the main entrance hall is perfect for those nights in on the couch.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are two bright double bedroom offering a comfortable space. With one single bedroom, the upstairs landing also has ample storage space. To complete the property the main family bathroom with integrated bath and shower offering a full range of amenities.\r\n\r\n\r\nNo. 79 is conveniently located making this a desirable opportunity for a number of different lifestyles. Located in the heart of Ballymun the M50 is 5 minutes by car while DCU is within walking distance. The close proximity to the City will also appeal to those commuting for work or socially. A range of public transport routes is also within easy reach. Only minutes away from many bus routes to include access to the greater Dublin area and beyond. Close to Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
